<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Account Deactivated</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#ffffff; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
  <div style="max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px 40px;">

    <img src="{{emailBannerUrl}}" alt="FormaChat" width="480" style="width:100%; max-width:480px; display:block; margin:32px auto 28px; border:0;">

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 16px;">Hello,</p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 8px;">
      This confirms that your FormaChat account was deactivated on <strong>{{deactivatedAt}}</strong>.
    </p>

    {{#if reason}}
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:16px 0 8px;"><strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}</p>
    {{/if}}

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:24px 0 8px;"><strong>What this means:</strong></p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.9; color:#333333; margin:0 0 24px;">
      - You can no longer access your account or dashboard.<br>
      - All your AI agents have been taken offline.<br>
      - Any active chat widgets on your sites will stop responding.<br>
      - You will not be billed for any future charges.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 8px;"><strong>Think this was a mistake?</strong></p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 28px;">
      We'd love to have you back. <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com?subject=Reactivate%20My%20FormaChat%20Account" style="color:#636b2f; font-weight:600;">Reach out</a> and we'll get your account and agents back online right away.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0;">We're sorry to see you go,<br>The FormaChat Team</p>

    <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #636b2f; opacity:0.25; margin:32px 0 20px;">

    <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; color:#999999; margin:0;">
      &copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.<br>
      Questions? <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com" style="color:#636b2f;">support@formachat.com</a>
    </p>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
